1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:12,400
Classmates are the people we spend the most time with at college, so maintaining a warm and friendly relationship with them is important for every student.
同学是我们在大学里相处时间最长的人，因此，与他们保持温暖友好的关系对每个学生来说都很重要。

2
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,980
There are several ways to build such a relationship.
建立这样的关系有几种方法。

3
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:19,780
First, we should treat others with respect and sincerity.
首先，我们应该以尊重和真诚的态度对待他人。

4
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,590
Listening patiently when classmates share their ideas and accepting their different habits and opinions can prevent many misunderstandings.
同学分享想法时耐心倾听，接纳他们不同的习惯和观点，可以避免许多误会。

5
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:36,650
Second, we should be willing to offer help, whether by explaining a difficult problem or by looking after a classmate who is ill.
其次，我们应该乐于提供帮助，无论是讲解一道难题，还是照顾生病的同学。

6
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:45,220
Third, taking part in group activities, such as class trips and team projects, gives us chances to get to know each other better.
第三，参加集体活动，比如班级出游和小组项目，能让我们有机会更好地相互了解。

7
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,680
A friendly relationship brings many benefits.
友好的关系会带来许多好处。

8
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:55,370
It creates a pleasant atmosphere in which everyone feels supported and less lonely when far from home.
它营造出一种愉快的氛围，让每个人都感到被支持，在远离家乡时也不那么孤单。

9
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:59,890
Classmates who get along well can also learn from each other’s strengths.
相处融洽的同学还能互相学习彼此的长处。

10
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:08,270
Moreover, the communication skills we develop in dealing with classmates will help us build good relationships in our future careers.
此外，我们在与同学相处中培养的沟通能力，将有助于我们在未来的职业生涯中建立良好的人际关系。

11
00:01:09,070 --> 00:01:13,030
Therefore, it is well worth the effort to be a kind and caring classmate.
因此，努力做一个友善、体贴的同学是非常值得的。
